{"id":"661226","name":"黑白木耳炒肉片","author":"凤梨小厨房","authorId":"8998709","desc":"","cover":"images/661226/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"瘦肉","amount":"100g"},{"name":"黑木耳（干）","amount":"20g"},{"name":"白木耳（干）","amount":"20g"},{"name":"蒜苗","amount":"3棵"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"两片"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"1粒"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"黑白木耳泡发，洗净；瘦肉切片，用油盐生粉腌一下；蒜苗切小段；姜蒜剁碎。","img":"images/661226/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"热锅下油，爆香姜蒜沫。","img":"images/661226/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"倒入肉片滑炒至变色。","img":"images/661226/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入黑白木耳。","img":"images/661226/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"翻炒片刻。","img":"images/661226/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入蒜苗翻炒片刻。","img":"images/661226/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入些许开水翻炒，盖上盖子焖煮。","img":"images/661226/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"分钟后开盖，加入盐和酱油再翻炒片刻。","img":"images/661226/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"出锅享用美味，我家孩子超爱吃。","img":"images/661226/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}